      "level": 2,
      "content": "Status",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Design.** Governed agent-callable tool for end-of-session lifecycle finalization. Wraps the existing `finalize_session_storage()` function in a Pydantic-contract tool.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Tool Name",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "`session_lifecycle_finalize`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Data Flow",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-8",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "SessionLifecycleFinalizeRequest\n       │\n       ▼\n  SessionLifecycleFinalizeTool.run()\n       │\n       ├── 1. Validate request (Pydantic)\n       ├── 2. Check dry_run flag → skip mutations\n       ├── 3. Call finalize_session_storage()\n       │       ├── audit → classify → protect → compact → prune\n       │       └── write manifest + receipt\n       └── 4. Return SessionLifecycleFinalizeResult",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
